# Pacing diagnostic (docs/re-battle-pacing.md): screenshot every frame of Jian's attack, the kill and
# one enemy turn in the first Delrich Temple battle, to find repeated (unchanged) frames. Same inputs
# as diag_pace_round up to round 1.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
wait 270
watch u16 0x0228296E round_state
exec 0x020297D4 bmain
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
